      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif frigman freum stelþ, III gebete, 7 cyning age þæt wite 7 ealle þa æhtan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a freeman steals from a freeman, let him pay 3[-fold], and the king obtains that fine or all the possessions.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif frigman freum stelþ, III gebete, 7 cyning age þæt wite 7 ealle þa æhtan.</ab>
